{"name":"Palomino","hex":"#bb7744","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Palomino","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname from Spanish."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Palomino"}],"entries":[{"title":"Palomino","blocks":[{"text":"Palomino is a genetic color in horses, consisting of a gold coat and white mane and tail; the degree of whiteness can vary from bright white to yellow. The palomino color derived from the breeding of Spanish horses in the United States. Genetically, the palomino color is created by a single allele of a dilution gene called the cream gene working on a \"red\" (chestnut) base coat. Palomino is created by a genetic mechanism of incomplete dominance, hence it is not considered true-breeding. However, most color breed registries that record palomino horses were founded before equine coat color genetics were understood as well as they are today, therefore the standard definition of a palomino is based on the visible coat color, not heritability nor the underlying presence of the dilution gene."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/53/Mare_and_foal_%28Kvetina-Marie%29.jpg/330px-Mare_and_foal_%28Kvetina-Marie%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palomino","wikidata":"Q1996502"},{"title":"Palomino (Miranda Lambert album)","blocks":[{"text":"Palomino is the eighth solo studio album by American country music singer Miranda Lambert, released through Vanner Records and RCA Records Nashville on April 29, 2022. It is her eighth solo studio album. Lambert produced the album alongside Luke Dick and Jon Randall and co-wrote 14 of the 15 tracks. It was preceded by the single \"If I Was a Cowboy\". This was her last album with Sony Music Nashville."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/43/Miranda_Lambert_-_Palomino.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palomino_(Miranda_Lambert_album)","wikidata":"Q111441917"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Quarter_Horse%28REFON%29-cleaned.jpg/500px-Quarter_Horse%28REFON%29-cleaned.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Quarter_Horse%28REFON%29-cleaned.jpg/1280px-Quarter_Horse%28REFON%29-cleaned.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Quarter_Horse%28REFON%29-cleaned.jpg/500px-Quarter_Horse%28REFON%29-cleaned.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AQuarter_Horse(REFON)-cleaned.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Ikon-_Golden_Akhal_Teke-Stallion.jpg/500px-Ikon-_Golden_Akhal_Teke-Stallion.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Ikon-_Golden_Akhal_Teke-Stallion.jpg/1280px-Ikon-_Golden_Akhal_Teke-Stallion.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cc/Ikon-_Golden_Akhal_Teke-Stallion.jpg/500px-Ikon-_Golden_Akhal_Teke-Stallion.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AIkon-_Golden_Akhal_Teke-Stallion.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Half-Arab_Western_Pleasure_Scottsdale_2017_16.jpg/500px-Half-Arab_Western_Pleasure_Scottsdale_2017_16.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/Half-Arab_Western_Pleasure_Scottsdale_2017_16.jpg/1280px-Half-Arab_Western_Pleasure_Scottsda